I sit at my desk.
A notebook and a pen are in front of me.
I make a grocery list.
What do I want this week?
I want rice.
I also want dal.
I write this in the notebook.
I want some spices.
Now, I think about fruits.
I like fresh fruits very much.
I like bananas.
I also like mangoes.
But mangoes are not in the market now.
So, I only write bananas in the list.
I want some vegetables too.
Now my list is ready.
I take the list and my cloth bag.
I go outside to the shop.
